# Local-only session handover (never committed; contains API keys)
# Convention: one file, HANDOVER.md, overwritten each session.
# Pattern keeps the older HANDOVER-YYYY-MM-DD.md form ignored too in case
# anyone accidentally reverts to that style.
HANDOVER.md
HANDOVER-*.md
